# CR 510.2, 704.3: combat damage is dealt simultaneously and state-based
# actions wait for it all. ai, at 2 life, takes 3 from the unblocked Hill Giant
# (-1) while Ajani's Sunstriker (2/2 lifelink) blocks Grizzly Bears and gains
# its controller 2 in the same damage event: the net is 1, so ai survives. The
# Bears and the Sunstriker trade.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1,2
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 3=2
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that kills both.
advance
